{
"i0": "***Countable*** nouns can be counted: *one apple, two apples*. ***Uncountable*** nouns can't: *water, rice, advice*. You can't say *two rices* or *an advice*.",
"i1": "The difference changes the words you use with them: *a, some, much, many, a few, a little*. See also [Much, Many, A Few, A Little](/blog/grammar/much-many-a-few-a-little/).",
"cun-basics.t": "Countable or uncountable?",
"cun-basics.s": "**Countable** nouns have a singular and a plural (*an apple, two apples*). **Uncountable** nouns have no plural and no *a / an* (*water, rice, money*), and they take a singular verb.",
"cun-basics.b0.h": "Countable | Uncountable",
"cun-basics.b0.0.0": "*a / an* + singular: *a banana, an egg*",
"cun-basics.b0.0.1": "no *a / an*: *bread, milk* (not *a bread*)",
"cun-basics.b0.1.0": "plural: *bananas, eggs*",
"cun-basics.b0.1.1": "no plural: *rice* (not *rices*)",
"cun-basics.b0.2.0": "*How many?* *many, a few*",
"cun-basics.b0.2.1": "*How much?* *much, a little*",
"cun-basics.b0.3.0": "*some / any* + plural: *some eggs*",
"cun-basics.b0.3.1": "*some / any*: *some milk*",
"cun-basics.b1": "Uncountable nouns are often **liquids** (*water, juice*), **materials** (*wood, paper, gold*), **food in a mass** (*rice, sugar, cheese*) and **ideas** (*love, help, time*).",
"cun-basics.b2": "Uncountable nouns take a **singular verb**: *The milk **is** in the fridge. Money **isn't** everything.*",
"cun-basics.n0": "countable / uncountable",
"cun-basics.n1": "singular verb",
"cun-basics.n2": "countable",
"cun-basics.n3": "uncountable",
"cun-basics.w0": "money: no plural",
"cun-basics.w1": "uncountable: singular verb",
"cun-basics.w2": "bread: no a",
"cun-tricky.t": "Tricky uncountable nouns: advice, information, news",
"cun-tricky.s": "Some nouns are **uncountable** in English but countable in many other languages: *advice, information, news, furniture, luggage, homework, equipment, traffic, weather, work, travel*.",
"cun-tricky.b0.h": "Uncountable (no *a*, no plural) | Countable alternative",
"cun-tricky.b0.0.0": "*advice*",
"cun-tricky.b0.0.1": "*a piece of advice, a tip*",
"cun-tricky.b0.1.0": "*information*",
"cun-tricky.b0.1.1": "*a piece of information, a fact*",
"cun-tricky.b0.2.0": "*news*",
"cun-tricky.b0.2.1": "*a piece of news, a news story*",
"cun-tricky.b0.3.0": "*furniture*",
"cun-tricky.b0.3.1": "*a chair, a table, a piece of furniture*",
