"cun-units.b0.6.0": "*a bag / packet / kilo of*",
"cun-units.b0.6.1": "*rice, sugar, flour*",
"cun-units.b0.7.0": "*a tube / jar / can of*",
"cun-units.b0.7.1": "*toothpaste / honey, jam / cola*",
"cun-units.b1": "The **unit** is countable, so it can be plural: *two **slices** of bread, three **bottles** of water*. The uncountable noun stays singular: *two slices of **bread*** (not *breads*).",
